{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29043","headline":"寓居开元精舍酬薛秀才见贻 · 许浑","name":"寓居开元精舍酬薛秀才见贻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知己萧条信陆沈，茂陵扶疾卧西林。\n芰荷风起客堂静，松桂月高僧院深。\n清露下时伤旅鬓，白云归处寄乡心。\n怜君诗句犹相忆，题在空斋夜夜吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}